 "notes": "Evaluation as registered: endpoint composition exact (JOINT hash matches the asset; R-118 module error 0.0), pilot on seeds 5076-5077 read only for the JOINT-versus-transplant discordance (0.203), the frozen formula asked for 3,987 pairs = 32 manifests (cap 40), confirmation on seeds 5078-5093 and 5114-5129, five policies once per manifest in fresh processes; 21,760 episodes of a 26,880 ceiling; no training, no LLM calls. Two process slips before the first cell, neither touching a result: `research.py start` ran before the box-side test had passed (a chained command did not stop on the failure; nothing had been launched), and the failure itself was 24 stale manifest copies left on the server by the earlier R-124 rename (the documented sync gap); they were deleted on the server and their 24 lines removed from the server's sync record, after which the tests passed. PRIMARY: JOINT minus the module-only transplant +0.0068, 95% [-0.0064, +0.0200] (394 wins, 366 losses; manifest-clustered [-0.009, +0.023]; Holm p 0.62): the interval includes zero and its upper bound (0.02003) sits on the registered +0.02, so the registered falsification rule (upper bound below +0.02) is not met by 0.00003 and no positive contribution is established: inconclusive, leaning against. The 2x2 is clear about where JOINT's gain lives: the MODULE block carries it (transplant minus R-118 +0.023 [+0.016, +0.031], 27 of 32 manifests; JOINT minus reciprocal +0.028 [+0.020, +0.035]) and the RESIDUAL block does not (reciprocal minus R-118 +0.002 [-0.012, +0.016]; JOINT minus transplant +0.007); interaction +0.004 [-0.006, +0.014]. Swapping the residual block changes which cases succeed (discordance 0.19-0.21) without changing how many; swapping the module block changes few cases (0.06) but mostly in one direction. Successes of 4,096: reference 1,740 (0.425), R-118 3,120 (0.762), transplant 3,215 (0.785), reciprocal 3,130 (0.764), JOINT 3,243 (0.792); drops 227 / 210 / 219 / 214 / 212. JOINT minus R-118 +0.030 [+0.016, +0.044] replicates D-086's +0.024. So the 43-coordinate JOINT is matched within about 0.02 by an 11-parameter module on the unchanged R-106 residual; that transplant is frozen as config/pen_spin/r126_transplant_finalist/ (derived, not trained; not installed). D-084's 'joint adaptation' contrast is thereby reinterpreted: what the joint arm found was mostly a better module (its threshold and ramp-out moved inside the widened ranges), not better residual coefficients. Nominal power only (pilot-estimated discordance, Holm)."
